What was taken: that one file of the data set, unchanged apart from its
name. It is test data only: it is read by the tests of buzzard-tdms and is
not part of the buzzard binary. Its checksums are in
crates/buzzard-tdms/tests/fixtures/README.md.

The tests of buzzard-tdms can also run npTDMS
